# Soburr — environment template
#
# The site needs NO API keys, tokens or database URLs at runtime: every
# geographic dataset and every texture is generated locally and served from
# this project's own `public/` directory. Nothing here is required to run
# `pnpm dev`, `pnpm build` or `pnpm start`.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` only if you need one of the optional switches below.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Extraction only (scripts/extract-world-data.mjs). Not read by the app.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# By default the extractor rejects a portfolio station anchor that is more than
# 60 m from the nearest drivable road, so a typo cannot place a destination in
# the lagoon. Set to "1" only for an experiment where a far station is expected.
# Leave unset for every shipped build.
ALLOW_FAR_STATIONS=
